# The public key becomes SWX_NATIVE_RES; the launcher shows Native resolution with 2160p (3840x2160).
# Legacy SWX_RES_BYPASS=1080p/1440p/4k still reads when the canonical key is absent (4k means 2160p); when both
# are set the canonical key wins, including 0. Saved macOS choice launcher.SWX_RES_BYPASS migrates once to
# launcher.SWX_NATIVE_RES (new kept when both exist, DM_SAVED_CHOICES=0 respected, legacy dropped so Reset cannot
# resurrect it); the env normalization runs before the fixed-key lists so UI and boot share the loader decision.
