# Picture shape, every row basic, Console mode stays in Game); render scale becomes a 50-120 % select filtered by
# the stub ceiling, a saved 1.00 reads as 1.0 by exact numeric equality (as the no-window boot does), an off-list
# saved choice falls back to 100 %, an env-fixed 0.95 still applies and shows 95 %, and a value too large to show
# keeps the picker's control instead of trapping. iOS keeps the slider and its sections.
